4:["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"A lot of people hear the same songs."}]," Those songs are on the radio, in stores, and on videos. We call that ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"popular music"}]," — the songs lots of people hear. We will ask: who picked those songs? What about the songs that are not on the radio?"]}]
